@Admin.WebApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5009

### Dev login (only in Development + Admin:DevAuth:Enabled=true)
POST {{Admin.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "change-me"
}

###
GET {{Admin.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/admin/settings
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
